## Summary

This project combines:
- **GPL-2.0-or-later** — the sender core (OwnTone-derived) + shims (new).
- **BSD-3-Clause** — the RTSP transport layer (evrtsp), compatible with GPL.
- **MIT** — pairing (pair_ap) and PTP clock sync (libairptp), compatible
  with GPL.

All components retain their original copyright notices and license text
in the vendored source tree (`Sources/CAirPlayEngine/`). The combined
linked work (AirPlayEngine + AudiouterCore + the app) is
GPL-2.0-or-later, per RESOLVED DECISIONS Q4 in `../PLAN-PHASE-2.md`. For
the full GPL-2.0 text, see `COPYING` in this directory.
